WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
[Bright music begins. A small yellow agent guide enters and starts the review.]

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:07.600
[The hosted browser measures the candidate at desktop and mobile sizes.]

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:11.200
[A failure receipt identifies the misaligned centers and undersized indicator slot.]

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:16.800
[The repair sets a 16-pixel value inset, a 48-pixel indicator slot, and a 16-pixel caret clearance.]

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:22.400
[The agent resubmits the repaired candidate for the same desktop and mobile checks.]

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:27.800
[The repaired candidate passes. The music lifts as the agent highlights the accepted receipt.]

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:35.200
[Confetti falls. The accepted composition remains on screen as the music resolves.]
